# TP2/DP4 with speculative decoding off -- the control for that layout, the way
# deepseek_v4_tp8dp1 is the control for TP8/DP1.
#
# It inherits the layout from deepseek_v4_tp2dp4_speculative and drops the one
# flag, so the pair differs in speculation and nothing else.
#
# This is the corner of the 2x2 where speculation is least likely to pay: four
# independent KV pools give the node the widest aggregate batch of any layout
# here, and a batch that already saturates compute is one the verify pass is
# charged full price for. Whether that is true of dspark on this hardware is a
# measurement, not a deduction -- which is what this profile is for.

PROFILE_BASE=deepseek_v4_tp2dp4_speculative

--speculative-config off
